*** Keywords ***
Configure Multi Sim Enb In CFG
    [Arguments]
    ...    ${enb_id_start}=11
    ...    ${enb_id_stop}=11
    ...    ${plmn}=311:489
    ...    ${ENB_S1_ADDR}=10.0.1.127
    ...    ${ENB_X2_ADDR}=10.0.1.130
    ...    ${ENB_X2U_ADDR}=10.0.1.136
    ...    ${x2_peer}=none
    ...    ${eci}=0x1234701
    ...    ${tac}=222
    ...    ${earfcn}=2000:20000
    ...    ${mapped_earfcn}=4200:22200
   [Documentation]  This keyword is to configure multiple simulated enbs in CFG FILE.
    ...    below sentence will be configured in cfg file
    ...
    ...    For example:
    ...    set_enb id=11 plmn=311:489 s1=$ENB11_S1_ADDR enb_id_macro=0x12347 daemon=10.0.2.1:22222 x2=10.0.1.130 x2u=10.0.1.136
    ...    type=simulated x2_peers=none
    ...    enb_param id=11 drb_id_begin=3 endc_capable_qci=all
    ...    set_cell id=1 enb=11 eci=0x1234701 pci=7:0 tac=222 proxy=10.0.2.1:12217|10.0.2.1:8887 earfcn=2000:20000 mapped_earfcn=4200:22200
    ...    mandatory_for_activation=off
    ...    enb_endc_param id=11 control_flow_period=3gpp1 use_nr_ran_cont=on serving_cell_index_range_scg=8:14
    ...
    ...    Robot Usage:
    ...    | Modify Cfg |
    ...    |     | Configure Multi Sim Enb In CFG | enb_id_start=11 | enb_id_stop=11 |
    FOR    ${enb_id}    IN RANGE    ${enb_id_start}    ${${enb_id_stop}+1}
        ${new_index}=    Evaluate    ${enb_id}-${enb_id_start}
        ${enb_id_macro}=    Get HEX value Sum    0x12347    ${new_index}
        ${ENB_S1_ADDR}=    Get IP Address Sum   ${ENB_S1_ADDR}    ${new_index}
        ${ENB_X2_ADDR}=    Get IP Address Sum    ${ENB_X2_ADDR}    ${new_index}
        ${ENB_X2U_ADDR}=    Get IP Address Sum   ${ENB_X2U_ADDR}    ${new_index}
        ${eci}=    Get HEX value Sum   ${eci}    ${new_index}
        ${V_1}    catenate
        ...    set_enb id=${enb_id} plmn=${plmn} s1=${ENB_S1_ADDR} enb_id_macro=${enb_id_macro} daemon=10.0.2.1:22222 x2=${ENB_X2_ADDR}
        ...    x2u=${ENB_X2U_ADDR} type=simulated x2_peers=${x2_peer}
        Update Cfg    ${V_1}
        Update Cfg    enb_param id=${enb_id} drb_id_begin=3 endc_capable_qci=all
        Update Cfg    enb_endc_param id=${enb_id} control_flow_period=3gpp1 use_nr_ran_cont=on serving_cell_index_range_scg=8:14
        ${V_2}    catenate
        ...    set_cell id=1 enb=${enb_id} eci=${eci} pci=7:${0+${new_index}} tac=${tac}
        ...    proxy=10.0.2.1:${12217+${new_index}}|10.0.2.1:${8887+${new_index}}
        ...    earfcn=${earfcn} mapped_earfcn=${mapped_earfcn} mandatory_for_activation=off
        Update Cfg    ${V_2}
    END

Get IP Address Sum
    [Arguments]    ${ip_address}    ${count}
    ${ip_prefix}    ${ip_rest}=    Split string from right    ${ip_address}    .    max_split=1
    ${ip_rest}=    Evaluate    ${ip_rest}+${count}
    ${ip_address}=    Set Variable    ${ip_prefix}.${ip_rest}
    Return From Keyword    ${ip_address}

Get HEX value Sum
    [Arguments]    ${value}    ${count}
    ${value}=    Convert To Integer    ${value}
    ${value}=    Convert To Hex    ${${value}+${count}}    prefix=0x
    Return From Keyword    ${value}

